    recorded 6,175 passes, two subsequently corrected fixture failures and 11 unrelated skips.
    [Correction checks](../artifacts/virtual-shadow-maps/texture-array-pool/20261111-215323/corrections-focused.trx)
    passed 27 cases; the remaining unsupported fault-hook target was corrected and its
    [final allocation-failure check passed 1/1](../artifacts/virtual-shadow-maps/texture-array-pool/20261111-215323/allocation-failure-corrected.trx).
    This is retained full-suite evidence plus focused corrections, not a fresh all-green full rerun.
    [Skip reasons](../artifacts/virtual-shadow-maps/texture-array-pool/20261111-215323/skips.json) remain explicit.
    The exercised cases include array-layer/tile isolation, contended writes, selective clearing,
