      batch, not a full allowance per group or array layer. Include demand and entity preparation costs.
      Charge geometry/view expansion, virtual raster footprint, tessellation/overdraw estimates, atomic
      workload, page clearing and retained/replacement memory; pixel rejection is not free work.
    ☑ Use directional/local reservations with borrowing and safe reclamation; retain independent sun/moon
