    ☐ Reject obsolete fog history on projection, depth replacement, temporal eligibility or readiness changes;
      history accumulation cannot extend stale expiry. Preserve simultaneous celestial/local behavior and
      measure compounded shadow lag and fog-history artifacts under moving lights.
